    <string name="hajj_companion_arafah_msg">Mbiru huru kwazvo: mira paArafah kubva masikati kusvika pakuvira kwezuva, uchiita kuteterera kwakawanda, takbir uye tahlil. Muporofita (PBUH) akati: “Hajj iArafah.”</string>
