    <string name="hajj_companion_nahr_msg">Eid al-Adha: dombo Jamarat al-Aqabah nematombo manomwe, ipa chibayiro, kuveura kana kudimburira, wozoita Tawaf al-Ifadah naSai.</string>
    <string name="hajj_companion_nahr_title">Zuva reAn-Nahr (10 Dhul-Hijjah)</string>
    <string name="hajj_companion_subtitle">Chiziviso chezuva nezuva chinokuyeuchidza nezvechiito chaidiwa panguva yayo mukati memazuva eHajj (8–13 Dhul-Hijjah)</string>
