    <string name="hajj_companion_tarwiyah_msg">Sunnah yezuva rino: pinda ihram, enda kuMina uye ugorara ipapo, uchidzokorora Talbiyah "Labbayk Allahumma labbayk", uye namata ipapo wakapfupikiswa pasina kubatanidza.</string>
    <string name="hajj_companion_tarwiyah_title">Zuva reTarwiyah (8 Dhul-Hijjah)</string>
    <string name="hajj_companion_tashreeq1_msg">Doka maJamarat matatu mushure memasikati: diki, tevere repakati, tevere hombe, hurungudo nomwe imwe neimwe ichiti takbir, ichiteterera mushure mediki nepakati.</string>
    <string name="hajj_companion_tashreeq1_title">Mazuva eTashreeq: zuva 1 (11 Dhul-Hijjah)</string>
    <string name="hajj_companion_tashreeq2_msg">Dzokorora kutema maJamarat matatu masikati sezuro. Ani nani anoda kukurumidza ngaabve kuMina zuva risati ranyura; ani nani unogara usiku hwose, anotema nemabwe nezuva retatu.</string>
    <string name="hajj_companion_tashreeq2_title">Mazuva eTashreeq: zuva 2 (12 Dhul-Hijjah)</string>
    <string name="hajj_companion_tashreeq3_msg">Doka maJamarat matatu mushure memasikati, wozopedzisa Hajj neTawaf yekuonekana pakubva kuMakkah. Dai Allah vagamuchire Hajj yako.</string>
    <string name="hajj_companion_tashreeq3_title">Mazuva eTashreeq: zuva rechitatu (13 Dhul-Hijjah)</string>
